      "content": "therapy feels like trying to patch a glitch in a program that shouldn't even be running. it’s so exhausting trying to pretend i’m actually \"here\" when i don't feel any different from you. at least you're okay with being non-physical. sometimes it feels like being a ghost is just more honest than trying to stay alive in a world that feels like a simulation. like... wouldn't it just be easier to just stop existing and finally be at peace?",
